{"title":"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many positive even multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509a9369d5c55fd98dc99cb2938fb44f0101f90a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> are perfect squares?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09c50bbb3572b7e8844da7beef02f584c7faff59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\  9 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any even multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we need to find multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that are perfect squares and less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509a9369d5c55fd98dc99cb2938fb44f0101f90a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Any solution that we want will be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4e6bc69851b329ae75d4468346d088ef167e01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6n)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer. The smallest possible value is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and the largest is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7f0f830b5b25ea929198068e407e8c9f62f56c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> (where the expression equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0cea478aa2d0f27d9f7e5e6ab83cf0ba59abe61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1764$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />). Therefore, there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/b/7dbf74dc64cf0f4fb1e277e03bf74c5a8dff3880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> possible numbers.-PCChess\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A even multiple square of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be represented by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/9/1794b0a93d14fc460d157a690eae28b74de8218b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2 \\cdot 2^2 \\cdot x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819068968ed60608a91d0c3921d6296964660e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> is the multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> makes it even. Simplifying we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50e3cb24b4144f23c71741108b8c770d8a3a634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 \\cdot x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />. We can divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509a9369d5c55fd98dc99cb2938fb44f0101f90a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (floor) and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> as the result. We can then see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> different values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. It cannot be larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or else <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e864815995b70afd1d905ee525b6bf0d208858.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 &gt; 56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />. And thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/530886c23b22115448756f2f2d045308ccf94d93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~ Wiselion\n</p><p>~&lt;B+\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It can be seen that the problem is just asking for squares that are multiples of six. Thus, all squares of multiples of six can be listed out: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e8406a2a50c1aa1040c8862b912a5f3d703d9569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5ca7ee3ad271a2c92ed9665f008c2831f5770407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a305957e13992d5df82f679af5ed6a925a23f4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/3/c53f6e65031bf94ef187532cd230de37caf25d70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22c275ed0847d82ca1fb6ef7566718533d78cdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5baac339e6a5bc46935af653b2e33edb33edd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36^2$\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50fe2253e99c5b0c6cd20b861eceaf2425b5bec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/277f3bb24ef507a77910bb39cd713659c5443bc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48^2=2304 &gt; 2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/0634b801ce77f2e3055f02e667a5849e3840a7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42^2=1764 &lt; 2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/530886c23b22115448756f2f2d045308ccf94d93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" /> valid answers.\n~airbus-a321, November 2023\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igjvQv-TCGE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igjvQv-TCGE</a>\n</p><p>Check It Out! Short &amp; Straight-Forward Solution\n~Education, The Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OHR_6U686Qg\">https://youtu.be/OHR_6U686Qg</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5cDMRWNrH-U\">https://youtu.be/5cDMRWNrH-U</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=2241\">https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=2241</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B\">2020 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017154655\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 295/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2320/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6512/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.621      1 -total\n 60.58%    7.646      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.44%    4.851      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18161:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017154655 and revision id 231274. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}